ivestock Improvement Association of Japan, Inc (LIAJ).</p></fn><fn id="nt108"><label/><p>Values different from those of donor cultured cells are indicated in boldface.</p></fn><fn id="nt109"><label>1, 2, 3, 4</label><p>Cloned calves born on 30 November 2007, 5 March, 22 and 31 July 2008, respectively.</p></fn><fn id="nt110"><label/><p>The probability that the genotype of a non-cloned animal would completely match the donor cells at these 13 loci is less than 10<sup>&#x02212;12</sup>.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="pone-0004142-t003" position="float"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pone.0004142.t003</object-id><label>Table 3</label><caption><title>DNA microsatellite analysis in 18 polymorphic loci<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="nt111">a</xref>.</title></caption><graphic id="pone-0004142-t003-3" xlink:href="pone.0004142.t003"/><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" alternate-form-of="pone-0004142-t003-3"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK069</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK024</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK102</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK097</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK106</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK068</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK039</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DIK096</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">BM6026</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yasufuku's frozen semen</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">163,163</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">239,245</td><t